43,"node_id":"RA_kwDOVbFais4qFVU3","name":"avalio-lite-0.5.0-setup.exe.b3","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Ran-n","id":31899984,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODk5OTg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31899984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n","html_url":"https://github.com/Ran-n","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ran-n/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":94,"digest":"sha256:13bc39ab485dbcb787213f261b7e7d6fb43f8832923182794e3a090578b5e408","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-11-03T15:13:43Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:13:44Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/releases/download/v0.5.0/avalio-lite-0.5.0-setup.exe.b3"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ran-n/avalio-lite/tarball/v0.5.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ran-n/avalio-lite/zipball/v0.5.0","body":"\n### Added\n\n- ⋯ → Duplicate class, with or without its pupils and marks; the copy is named e.g. \"1A (2)\" and opens at once\n- The sidebar folds to a narrow strip of icons with the « button or Ctrl+B, giving the sheet more width; the choice is remembered\n- ‹ and › in a column's settings panel, and Alt+← / Alt+→, open the next or previous column's settings without closing the panel\n- Ctrl+← and Ctrl+→ move a column left or right while its settings panel is open\n- Desktop test baselines for 125 % and 150 % display scaling\n\n### Changed\n\n- The app's core state moved out of the UI code and was split by concern; no visible change\n- Source reorganised by feature; no visible change\n- Tests strengthened after mutation testing: every mutant in the grade calculation, columns, cells, migrations, file moves, PIN rules, languages and app state is caught\n- The desktop tests open the window on the primary monitor, so the display scale they test no longer depends on where the mouse is; a test also guards the module dependency rules\n\n### Fixed\n\n- The sheet's menus no longer stay open, partly cut off, when the window is resized\n- Escape now closes a column's settings panel after a click in it and from every one of its fields\n- The window no longer opens partly off-screen on smaller or scaled displays: it opens centred on the current screen, sized to fit, and maximised when the screen is too small\n\n\n### Install\n\nDownload `avalio-lite-0.5.0-setup.exe` to install it (per user, no admin), or `avalio-lite-0.5.0-portable.exe` to run it from any folder. The files are not code-signed: if Windows SmartScreen warns, choose **More info → Run anyway** (see the README). Each file has a BLAKE3 checksum (`.b3`).\n"}